abstract: >
  This repository contains a synthetic Passive Optical Network (PON) traffic dataset,
  a Jupyter notebook, experimental results, and figures for machine-learning-based
  traffic classification using K-Nearest Neighbors, Random Forest, and Support Vector Machine.
